{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "bfdc0eb635f1b438f76e3fd34f0bb13a04196bb91f22ab931c93196723efef51", "ja": "15歳の壁", "zh": "15岁之壁", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "192d00916e49b43d07aff0897107bc73b2d43df9194a672dcd4849654bad90e0", "ja": "大人になれている気がしないやよいと可奈は\nたまたまチケットを持っていた映画がR15\n指定と気づき、壁を越えるため見に行くべき\nかとどぎまぎする。結局行けなかった二人は\n自分達はまだ子供だと悟って笑うのだった。", "zh": "觉得自己还没成长为大人的弥生和可奈\n偶然发现手头有票的电影是R15\n级，为了跨越障碍，两人心慌意乱地纠结\n是否该去看。最终没能成行的两人\n意识到自己还只是个孩子，相视而笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8be7de85feb18d19facab4ef4aa12025252e76881aabd6433a86243f4a68900b", "ja": "（やよいと可奈のデュオ公演本番が迫ってきた\nものの……この間の二人、少し気になったな）", "zh": "（可奈和弥生的双人公演马上就要正式开始了……不过，前阵子的她们俩，还是让我有点在意啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f6f74995a4fc1cf528afa12748a0aff618df2b57fe4d9d9268dc4555dd80d2af", "ja": "（あまり口出ししたくはないけど……\nこまめに様子を見た方がいいかもしれない）", "zh": "（虽然不太想过多干涉……但或许还是应该多留意一下她们的情况。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "0384358490b6ecef602dfa101ca94a0c23cd75af715bf40b34ac2915009ca710", "ja": "可奈ちゃん……。私たち、お仕事も\nレッスンも順調だとは思うけど……。", "zh": "可奈……我觉得我们工作和练习都进展得挺顺利的，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "4afbe9373cfd26da16cb5b2687d6c8c2657c6434936794578e856e9e96b914a2", "ja": "でも……\n全然大人にはなれてる気しないなーって……。", "zh": "但是……\n总觉得我们完全没有变得成熟起来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "df3b269ccbbdb83a347ae9f5e266098d57302eeb9993202b4c96e56388934eb2", "ja": "うん、私も同じこと思ってたんだ。\nきっと、なにか足りないんだよね……？", "zh": "嗯，我也在想同一件事。\n肯定还缺少了些什么吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "b8cbdb8315960d11fccd82a1cff186757be5d9dcaf3b5535d4135d8547d6bafa", "ja": "私たちに足りないもの……。\nあれ？", "zh": "我们所缺少的东西……。\n咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1006_se", "source_sha256": "bccac1194262b64bd0942413a30e70d4ca040794e8eecbf4304ff40aa2cfc6c0", "ja": "パサッ……", "zh": "（翻阅……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "ec9e741d04906e588655030ac6c8118b444db4da71418e9f14c2e47d0c16bf13", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、ポケットからなにか落ちたよ。\nこれ、映画のチケット？　……あ。", "zh": "可奈，有东西从口袋里掉出来了哦。\n这个是电影票？……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "5ff5eee357d8484df27cef0beae6040d752e20af95da959efa7ba6a2054d6b11", "ja": "！！　こ、これは違うのやよいちゃん！\n全然そんな、あの、そういうつもりのじゃなくて！", "zh": "！！这、这不是那回事啦，弥生！\n完全不是，那个，我没有那种意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "a1ed643f5d63faae450e052911fc5c5e5ba1ffe3a53e592b299980fa7f387e51", "ja": "この映画のチケット、私も持ってるよ！\n撮影スタジオに無料チケットが置いてあったよね♪", "zh": "这部电影的票，我也有哦！\n摄影棚里放着免费票，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "8bb8b2eb9bef3908df75623e98622c0dbe6fa02218d627d55aee2c9dd7a58cee", "ja": "え、ええええーーっ！？\nやよいちゃんも、持ってたの？", "zh": "诶，诶诶诶诶——！？\n弥生也有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "49a33c5e55af05f65be432731e9afaaa9773e2a63f78ec04666069c463b20bae", "ja": "うん。あ、でも有効期限がもうすぐで……\nそうだ、よかったら一緒に観に行こうよ！", "zh": "嗯。啊，不过有效期马上就要到了……\n对了，方便的话一起去看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "92811ee37a124288c02dfeef4c4d68e084c95573aaf3947c7d0d4740a7ae845d", "ja": "い……行くの？\nでも、あの、これ……R15指定だけど……？", "zh": "去……去吗？\n可是，那个，这个……是R15限制级哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "750daa67467bc693766df7117da7936a079a365c529ffac6bf44d23be2954732", "ja": "あーるじゅうごしてい……。\nえええええーーーっ！？", "zh": "R十五指定……。\n诶诶诶诶诶——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "b7868dbf35d59f80ffb66ecad76abea4fe6dd48c38e8f20a27c6d095a5df046b", "ja": "ち、違うの！　私はただ、チケットの女の子が\n可愛いなーって思っただけで～！", "zh": "不、不是的！我只是觉得票上的女孩子很可爱嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "cb9b9283b606fb3e413bab1f980e0f48d8fd6f59e3123789d77915ed58ddc261", "ja": "わ、私はね！　主演の人がミュージカルの人で、\nすごくファンで、内容知らないで買っちゃって……！", "zh": "我、我只是因为主演是音乐剧演员，特别喜欢她，一时没看内容就买下来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "4d99327d9fd945c4132ab48eebf3f2ec1c35ef6e16ab1341bd400a5b55088b35", "ja": "そ、そうだったんだ……。\nあー、びっくりしたぁ……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊……。\n啊——吓我一跳……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "033eb10e86fc9777f9b2efaf1945dbe9d2e8a82a94d6f2111d96f66d3f85d6aa", "ja": "う、うん……。\nでも、すごい偶然だね……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……。\n不过，还真是巧啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "3f663006c1b5be1a0ab0c27c1a02da71f0d472e74f77297064ebb4d67bb25045", "ja": "……。念のために確認するけど、\n私たち14歳、だよね……？", "zh": "……。我保险起见确认一下，\n我们是14岁，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "d59d33fb10639cd6919abae7d534b04b353fc9e40d9448326cb2717815d6b40e", "ja": "うん……。\nそれで、この映画はR15指定……。", "zh": "嗯……。\n然后，这部电影是R15级……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "e72993acdef09aa23111ea9605a767b2afe1cd3020493ccb46c617c075b020c0", "ja": "……。\n私たちに足りないもの、って……。", "zh": "……。\n我们所欠缺的东西，难道是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "f0c7f7c942ade0c49400af65e48dd0fda785beb66e92a817ecf4103dacd65ecb", "ja": "ううっ……ちょっと思ったけど！\nでも、よくないことだし……！", "zh": "呜呜……虽然我刚才闪过一个念头！\n可是，那样做不太好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "68f3f80f4ca95e82fdafeefe2ff09e4606f747a479ec9d617d5ebce781013dd9", "ja": "……。\nやよいちゃん、明日ってお休みだよね……？", "zh": "……。\n弥生，明天休息对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "5cfabc15cf916caa64198695cc4d97ce85e6d9e3aae8687eb713a34b32176def", "ja": "可奈ちゃんもだよね……？\n……有効期限、近いよね……。", "zh": "可奈也是吧……？\n……有效期快到了吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "4a3b56533eef602861da0fbb92948e844f978df1ff07c01d11c4bab5a0699c06", "ja": "う～～～～～～～～～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～～～～～～～～～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "4a3b56533eef602861da0fbb92948e844f978df1ff07c01d11c4bab5a0699c06", "ja": "う～～～～～～～～～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～～～～～～～～～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "a3ba981ac2a877b1fc71c87d25513e9ce83674fd9ce74b00816c5984f1f2d8e2", "ja": "えーっと、明日とりあえず駅前に集合して、\nそれから相談して決めるっていうのは……どう！？", "zh": "那个，明天先在车站前集合，然后再商量决定……怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "93e8cd546d42fc11f163b08c387e79372a35ead2ccb99468fe581b9348400b52", "ja": "う、うん、それがいいと思う！\nそうしよう！", "zh": "嗯、嗯，我觉得那样挺好！\n就这么办吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1028_null", "source_sha256": "9b7bea9b276f614cef4e429ebb51b4559921d4812f1c559e96550875f344e580", "ja": "明朝……", "zh": "明天早上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "59b5aaec735b47eafa7aadea4cfc7ec08bd18f310a77cc688668ef87ba99643f", "ja": "……むにゃ……むぅ……ん、はれっ！？\nもしかして、寝坊した！？", "zh": "……唔喵……唔……嗯，哎呀！？\n难道说，我睡过头了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "1460aea65c75438f9fa61c7b561a235ca1e60f75cd356fa194081ec74b09b0ad", "ja": "た、大変だ～！\n急いで慌てて準備しなくっちゃ！！", "zh": "太、太糟糕了～！\n得赶紧慌慌张张地准备才行！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "f3393900a236daa4203be987938220cdf5f5c4c45fd7baf8ad059e147dc009a8", "ja": "うう、久しぶりに大遅刻やっちゃった～！\nやよいちゃんにもすぐ連絡しないと！", "zh": "呜呜，久违地迟到了好久啊～！\n得赶紧联系弥生才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "d6f7e49d4164b65b6bdcde2787d335edffec41e5ab79fc155424b98599f388cf", "ja": "……あれ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1033_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "51c65b89ebb5a1f8bbbc71d6f63e4a14a86d56f5f1aa2a4b025db832e9768215", "ja": "やよいちゃん……。\n今日は遅刻しちゃってごめんね？", "zh": "弥生……。\n今天我迟到了，对不起哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "8c1e061522e7847e0fab5fc2f30c1523e3e9bb485aaf6a575da4bd67d79c290d", "ja": "ううん、私も寝坊しちゃったから。\n昨日の夜はちっとも寝れなくて……。", "zh": "没事的，我也睡过头了。\n昨天晚上一筹莫展地睡不着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e38879584bc36c35989ceca17073c53d746612e315d3327d6acec9e383f5bb5", "ja": "実は私も……。\nベッドの中でずっと考え事しちゃって……。", "zh": "其实我也……一直躺在床上想事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "81cef83baeb3a986f0d2197890342bff6a2d471760ae2584714090fda6b71083", "ja": "お洋服はやっぱり大人っぽいのがいいのかなとか、\nもし怖い内容だったらどうしよう、とか……。", "zh": "比如，衣服是不是还是成熟一点的比较好，\n要是内容很吓人该怎么办……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1038_005yay", "source_sha256": "b0e5f27268a4d9770444ffb6cca173da7a22895d7069f50e5a2e6dea2d4640e2", "ja": "私もおんなじ。あと、今朝気付いたんだけど、\n入場の時に年齢確認されるかもーって。", "zh": "我也一样。而且，我今天早上才注意到，进场的时候可能还会被查年龄——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "6ba2968dc8e223cc1b2e6619fc8108835603cdc0a339633d969af8f6387b6e46", "ja": "あっ！　……じゃあ、\n二人で行っても観れなかったんだ……。", "zh": "啊！……那就算我们\n两个人一起去，也看不成了啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1040_005yay", "source_sha256": "b7eacbec84d97a8c9ae2586c411c7de513684566319771dc93bcf8069d3bc005", "ja": "昨日、二人であんなに真剣に、\nドキドキしながら悩んだのにね……。", "zh": "昨天，我们两个人那么认真地，\n心跳加速地烦恼了半天……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "df12805727e5b381e3ec424d5e280e5932dec56975de3a745ed0479070e48856", "ja": "やっぱり私たちって、\n全然大人じゃないんだね……ふふっ。", "zh": "我们果然，\n还完全算不上大人呢……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "5d42a95a90d2d14b1c585e560a054903edb310af30742d9e5099e59a9ec91dbb", "ja": "お疲れさま。\nあれ、今日は二人ともオフのはずだけど……？", "zh": "辛苦啦。咦，你们两个今天不是都应该休息吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_05_1043_005yay", "source_sha256": "0e3625e62bc013b53fcea2c81665c0033e1d11f0f65c0b98d009d9f7f68aa8a3", "ja": "……えへへっ。", "zh": "……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
